      "description": "A scene composed of two individuals, a woman and a man, positioned vertically one above the other, with text overlaid on the image. The woman is at the top, and the man is at the bottom, creating a visual contrast. The text 'when nobody knew who you were until you got on your knees.' is split across the top and bottom, framing each individual. The scene implies a comparison or commentary on their public recognition or perceived value.",
